        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer LB8002-454-630, 4-1/2\" x 4\" x Square Corners Stainless Steel Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese 4-1/2\" x 4\" stainless steel hinges use a special nylon bearing material that is maintenance free and requires little to no oil or grease. The special nylon bearings eliminate the use of any steel parts that could easy rust.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes one (1) complete hinge with matching finish stainless steel flathead, Phillips Drive #12 x 1-1/4\" wood screws and 12-24 x 1/2\" machine screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: with Non-Removable Pin use <a href=\"/products/4-1-2-x-4-stainless-steel-hinge-with-lube-bearing-and-non-removable-pin-bommer-lb8002-454n-630\"><b>Bommer LB8002-454N-630</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, removable, rust resistant, stainless steel flush tip hinge pin. Medium duty door hinge, standard .134\" thickness. Standard full mortise hinge with 3 knuckle design.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/bommer-LB8002-454-hinge_size.gif?v=1704442261\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer LB8002-454 Stainless Hinge Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Bommer LB8002-454-630 4-1/2\" x 4\" Stainless Steel Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel, Removable</li>\r\n<li>Bearing: Nylon Bearings</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Full Mortise</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.134\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Non-Rising Removable Pin</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Full Mortise - Conforms to ANSI A5112 for Bearing Hinges</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: 4 ea. #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: 8 ea. #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LB8002-454.pdf?v=1691094996\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer LB8002-454 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage with stainless steel machine screws and wood screws. For use with both metal and wood  doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>**Item Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/stainless-steel-hinges\">Stainless Door Hinges</a></b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
